;
; Evidence policy: docs/clean-room.md v3 (2026-09-18).  Every entry is
; grounded in the official Microsoft Windows CE documentation preserved
; in kagurasumusun/wince-docs-corpus:
;
; 1. DOC-DERIVED -- the name (or, for Unicode-only exports, the generic
;    name without the W suffix) appears on an official CE documentation
;    page whose Requirements row / APILocation metadata names
;    Coredll.lib (Coredll.lib pages scanned across the CE .NET /
;    CE 5.0 / CE 6.0 books on 2026-09-18; page ids recorded in
;    docs/def-audit-coredll-2026-09-18.tsv).
; 2. PENDING-REGROUNDING -- the name is the exact title of a page in the
;    official per-version TOC catalogs whose Requirements row has not
;    been harvested yet (page queued in wince-docs-corpus
;    urls/to-fetch-mslearn.txt); the entry stays until the page is read
;    and either confirms Coredll.lib or drops the name (ledger:
;    docs/def-audit-coredll-2026-09-18.tsv).
;
; The former EXPORT-SURFACE-VERIFIED tier (names taken from
; device-dump-audited import surfaces) was REMOVED on 2026-09-18:
; dump-derived information is out of scope under policy v3 section 3
; (882 entries, ledgered in the audit file).  Ordinals are not
; published; entries are name-only.
